WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.217 --> 00:00:02.670
- We are back, and it's
our gutsy hour, everybody.

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:04.920
And our next guest is
a very talented actor

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.120
and an amazing musician.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:06.953
He does it all.

00:00:06.953 --> 00:00:08.910
He's one of the bestselling Latin artists

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.050
out there right now.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:11.790
He is nominated this year

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.770
for Best Latin Album at the Grammys,

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:15.471
which is incredible.
(audience cheers)

00:00:15.471 --> 00:00:17.250
His latest album is called "Don Juan".

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.170
You can check it out
wherever you get your music.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.853
Say hello to Maluma.

00:00:20.853 --> 00:00:23.853
(audience cheering)

00:00:39.661 --> 00:00:40.783
- Oh no, I was kidding, I was kidding.

00:00:40.783 --> 00:00:43.337
- I know, I know, I was like,
it gets a little scary here.

00:00:43.337 --> 00:00:45.300
- In case you guys
forget a Christmas tree.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.380
- Yes.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.213
I love it.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:48.690
Green is my favorite color, Maluma.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:49.740
- Oh really?
- Yes.

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:52.080
- Well, mine is purple,
but for today it's red.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.410
- Yeah.

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:54.420
So anyway, I have to say,

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.610
what's your gutsiest moment
you feel like in life?

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:58.740
- Well, actually I brought a picture.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:00:59.573
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:59.573 --> 00:01:01.234
- Yeah, I need to show you guys, yeah.

00:01:01.234 --> 00:01:02.067
- Okay.

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:05.673
- Now in this picture is
totally pink, you see?

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:08.460
It's not the gutsy moment though.

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:09.960
- It's not.
- No, no, no, no.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:13.857
This was the first time that
I went on tour after COVID,

00:01:13.857 --> 00:01:16.260
and I was the first Latino artist,

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:19.230
actually to say that I wanted
to tour again after COVID.

00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:20.580
It was pretty dangerous.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:24.630
But it was like the pioneer
after COVID hit so bad.

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:27.090
So I felt like, okay, I need to.

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:27.923
- No, that is a gutsy moment.

00:01:27.923 --> 00:01:28.756
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:28.756 --> 00:01:30.090
- I need to, yeah, I need to do it.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:32.400
And after that, I saw all my colleagues

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:33.570
doing it at the same time.

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:36.425
So that was like pretty
nice to be the first artist.

00:01:36.425 --> 00:01:37.258
- That's really brave,

00:01:37.258 --> 00:01:38.280
'cause people were getting a lot of

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.510
like, "Ugh, should we do it?

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:40.343
Should we not do it?"

00:01:40.343 --> 00:01:41.176
It was very scary.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:41.176 --> 00:01:44.250
Of course, we did it in
a pretty responsible way.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:45.083
- Yeah.
- Of course.

00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:46.230
Because it was kind of tough.

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:50.160
It was 2019, you know? So, but
it was a great, a great tour.

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:51.750
All the arenas were sold out, thank God.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.100
So it was beautiful.
- Yeah.

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:54.840
Well, congratulations.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:56.160
You're nominated for another Grammy.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:57.281
- Thank you.
- Yeah.

00:01:57.281 --> 00:01:59.425
(audience cheering)

00:01:59.425 --> 00:02:00.779
- [Kelly] That's so exciting.

00:02:00.779 --> 00:02:01.612
- [Maluma] Thank you.

00:02:01.612 --> 00:02:03.630
- I'm gonna tell you, my
first Grammys I ever went to

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:05.310
is actually the Latin Grammys.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:06.390
It was my first one.

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:08.640
I did a duet and they asked me to sing

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:09.960
and I was like, sure.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:10.793
- No way.

00:02:10.793 --> 00:02:11.760
- But I love the American Grammy.

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:13.620
I love the English Grammys,
but the Latin Grammys

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:15.000
were so great.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.300
They were so passionate and
so, I love the performances.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:19.133
- [Maluma] Thank you.

00:02:19.133 --> 00:02:19.966
- It was a really wonderful experience.

00:02:19.966 --> 00:02:20.835
- Thank you.

00:02:20.835 --> 00:02:23.370
You know that I've never been
performing at the Grammys,

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:24.930
like the American Grammys.

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:26.940
I only been performing in Latin Grammys,

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:28.680
but we're waiting for this opportunity

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:30.330
because this a big thing for me.

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:33.210
You know, like being nominated
to the American Grammys

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.760
with an album that is full in Spanish.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:36.593
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:36.593 --> 00:02:37.470
- The whole album, that's a big deal.

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:39.455
- Yeah.
(audience cheering)

00:02:39.455 --> 00:02:40.574
It's great.

00:02:40.574 --> 00:02:41.407
- That's beautiful.

00:02:41.407 --> 00:02:42.990
I feel happy.

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:44.190
I wanna perform.

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:45.023
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:45.023 --> 00:02:47.070
- That's my dream to go there, perform,

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:48.960
and taking the Grammy with me

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.640
and taking to Colombia, you know?

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:51.924
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:51.924 --> 00:02:52.757
- For my Latino community.

00:02:52.757 --> 00:02:54.390
That would be amazing.

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:55.230
- You know what's funny

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.492
is you just reminded me of something.

00:02:56.492 --> 00:02:58.110
That's always my goal.

00:02:58.110 --> 00:02:59.280
I always tell God, I'm like,

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:01.440
I don't care if I win, but
I really wanna perform.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.273
I love performing.
- [Maluma] Yeah.

00:03:02.273 --> 00:03:04.470
- Because I feel like that's
the best way to sell yourself

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:06.007
to an audience that
might not know you yet.

00:03:06.007 --> 00:03:07.240
- I know, yeah.
- Is the performance part.

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:09.270
- Yeah, that's my favorite part.

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:10.560
That's what I love the most.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:12.270
Going, perform, have fun.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:14.250
See my friends, some colleagues, you know.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.210
It's a great night.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.160
Let's see what happens in this awards.

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:19.080
But if you guys are watching me right now,

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:19.980
please vote for me.

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:22.340
- Yeah.
(audience cheering)

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:23.640
Absolutely, absolutely.

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.770
I will vote for you, I'm a voter.

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:28.350
Okay, be sure to check
out Maluma's latest album.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:30.200
It's called "Don Juan," it's out now.

